# Probe list: one URL per line; results on results/probe (numbered from 1, comments skipped). Older rounds are in git history.
# Prefixes: "RANGE " first 16 KB only; "FULL " keep the whole answer (up to 20 MB) as N.bin. Don't FULL files with personal
# data: the results branch is public.
